1
00:00:01,916 --> 00:00:03,875
Wait, Lady Livia,

2
00:00:03,875 --> 00:00:05,833
did you just say you broke off the engagement 

3
00:00:05,833 --> 00:00:06,875
with Lord Severin?

4
00:00:09,458 --> 00:00:12,666
Yes, we're finished.

5
00:00:12,666 --> 00:00:15,791
Lord Severin is a
man of heavenly talent,

6
00:00:15,791 --> 00:00:17,708
and he cared for
you more than anyone.

7
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Yet you were foolish
enough to throw him away.

8
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:23,500
Your family is
headed straight for ruin.

9
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:24,833
You'd better prepare yourself.

10
00:00:26,708 --> 00:00:30,708
Severin, who the
hell are you really?

11
00:00:32,166 --> 00:00:34,791
If you have this
kind of terrifying power,

12
00:00:34,791 --> 00:00:36,833
why were you cast
out by your family?

13
00:00:37,291 --> 00:00:39,708
Why were you slaving
away in the mines?

14
00:00:40,166 --> 00:00:42,291
Why didn't you
just help me openly?

15
00:00:42,291 --> 00:00:44,708
We've known each otherfor over ten years.

16
00:00:46,250 --> 00:00:46,916
So?

17
00:00:47,375 --> 00:00:48,833
Do you know why
I proposed to you?

18
00:00:51,625 --> 00:00:52,833
Why?

19
00:00:52,833 --> 00:00:55,166
Back then your family
had fallen on hard times.

20
00:00:55,166 --> 00:00:56,833
The other nobles
treated you like dirt.

21
00:00:56,833 --> 00:00:57,416
You cried to me,

22
00:00:57,416 --> 00:00:59,541
saying you just wanted a quiet life with an ordinary man.

23
00:00:59,958 --> 00:01:01,833
I used my father's exile as cover,

24
00:01:01,833 --> 00:01:03,958
and quietly cleared every obstacle in your path

25
00:01:03,958 --> 00:01:05,291
so you could
rise to the top.

26
00:01:06,250 --> 00:01:08,833
But I never expected
that once you gained power,

27
00:01:08,833 --> 00:01:10,291
you'd forget who
you used to be.

28
00:01:12,583 --> 00:01:16,583
So you stayed in the
shadows, just to protect my pride?

29
00:01:16,583 --> 00:01:18,666
You can see it that way.

30
00:01:20,958 --> 00:01:23,333
Baby, don't listen to him.

31
00:01:23,333 --> 00:01:25,708
He's lying through his teeth.

32
00:01:27,083 --> 00:01:28,291
What?

33
00:01:28,291 --> 00:01:29,666
Campbell himself said 

34
00:01:29,666 --> 00:01:32,000
it was just a few words of advice.

35
00:01:32,375 --> 00:01:34,041
It wasn't him who did anything.

36
00:01:34,750 --> 00:01:36,333
No one except the Godfather

37
00:01:36,333 --> 00:01:38,208
could pull off something like that.

38
00:01:38,458 --> 00:01:41,916
It was all just coincidence.

39
00:01:42,708 --> 00:01:44,125
A bunch of idiots.

40
00:01:45,208 --> 00:01:48,291
Honey, shall I give
the order right now

41
00:01:48,291 --> 00:01:50,250
to wipe both
their families from Golantis?

42
00:01:50,500 --> 00:01:52,166
Wipe us out?

43
00:01:53,291 --> 00:01:56,333
Didn't you hear Steward Jeyn's promise to Livia?

44
00:01:56,333 --> 00:01:59,208
Once we connect with
the Sovereign Sanctum through him,

45
00:02:00,375 --> 00:02:03,500
the Morellan family won’t mean shit!

46
00:02:03,500 --> 00:02:05,083
Keep dreaming.

47
00:02:05,083 --> 00:02:08,791
The Sovereign Sanctum won't even spare you a glance.

48
00:02:08,791 --> 00:02:11,833
That's not for you to decide.

49
00:02:13,541 --> 00:02:14,583
Of course not.

50
00:02:16,625 --> 00:02:18,625
But my husband decides.

51
00:02:21,833 --> 00:02:23,083
Your husband?

52
00:02:23,083 --> 00:02:26,041
This disowned loser who can only talk big?

53
00:02:29,875 --> 00:02:33,041
Steward Jeyn of the
Sovereign Sanctum has arrived!
